 "remarks": "Full of Rowayton charm, this 3-bedroom, 2-bath rental offers 1,813 square feet of comfortable living space and a private backyard retreat. Mature plantings surround the lot, giving it a lush, well-landscaped feel and plenty of privacy. Enjoy morning coffee on the front porch overlooking the tree-lined street, or unwind out back in your own secluded yard. New sidewalks make it an easy walk to town, the shops and restaurants, and the Rowayton train station, so commuting and weekend errands couldn't be simpler. A wonderful place to call home in one of Rowayton's most sought-after locations",
